DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250314
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250315
SUMMARY:Shaheedi Divas — Jathedar Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji (Battle of Naushehra) · ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਜਥੇਦਾਰ ਅਕਾਲੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਫੂਲਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਜੰਗ ਨੌਸ਼ਹਿਰਾ)
DESCRIPTION:1 Chet 2082 · 1 Chet\, Sambat 2082 (1 Chet\, Sambat 1879)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:26 PM\, 14 Mar\nMartyrdom of Jathedar of Sri Akal Takht Sahib and Budha Dal\, Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji Nihung\, leading the victorious Khalsa charge at the Battle of Naushehra (1823 CE).\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Panth Prakash (Giani Gian Singh) (Entry: Phula Singh Akali · Battle of Naushehra\, 1 Chet 1879)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:SHAHEEDI\,Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
