SUMMARY:Vaisakhi — 326th Khalsa Sajna Divas\, Panj Pyare & Maharaja Ranjit Singh Raj Tilak · ਵੈਸਾਖੀ — ੩੨੬ਵਾਂ ਖ਼ਾਲਸਾ ਸਾਜਨਾ ਦਿਵਸ\, ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ ਅਤੇ ਮਹਾਰਾਜਾ ਰਣਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਰਾਜ ਤਿਲਕ
DESCRIPTION:1 Vaisakh 2082 · 1 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2082 (Mesha Sankranti)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:27 AM\, 14 Apr\n326th anniversary of the revelation of the Khalsa Panth (1 Vaisakh 1756 Bikrami / 1699 CE) with Panj Pyare at Takhat Sri Kesgarh Sahib.\nSources: Sri Gur Sobha (Kavi Sainapati) (Chapter 5 · Revelation of the Khalsa Panth on 1 Vaisakh 1756 Bikrami) | Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Khalsa Mahima) (Khalsa Mero Roop Hai Khaas)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
