DESCRIPTION:1 Vaisakh 2082 · 1 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2082 (Vaisakhi — Sambat 1756 & 1858)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:27 AM\, 14 Apr\nHonoring all Five Beloved Ones (Bhai Daya Singh\, Bhai Dharam Singh\, Bhai Himmat Singh\, Bhai Mohkam Singh & Bhai Sahib Singh Ji) consecrated on Vaisakhi 1699\, and Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji’s Raj Tilak at Lahore (1 Vaisakh\, Sambat 1858).\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Prachin Panth Prakash (1 Vaisakh 1756 (Panj Pyare) & 1 Vaisakh 1858 (Maharaja Ranjit Singh Raj Tilak))\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
