DESCRIPTION:7 Poh 2082 · 7 Poh\, Sambat 2082 (Parivar Vichhora & Shahi Tibbi)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:53 AM\, 22 Dec\nSeparation of Guru Gobind Singh Ji’s family at the flooded Sarsa River (Parivar Vichhora)\, Asa Di Vaar amid battle\, and the legendary martyrdom of Bhai Uday Singh Ji (Shahi Tibbi) and Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji (Malikpur/Kotla Nihang).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 2\, Ansu 1–12 · Sarsa Nadi\, Shahi Tibbi & Kotla Nihang (7 Poh 1761))\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
