DESCRIPTION:8 Poh 2082 · 8 Poh\, Sambat 2082 (Garhi Chamkaur\, 1761 Bikrami)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:15 PM\, 23 Dec\nMartyrdom of Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji\, Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji\, three Panj Pyare (Bhai Himmat Singh\, Mohkam Singh\, Sahib Singh Ji)\, and 40 Singhs of Chamkaur.\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Zafarnama) (Verse 19 · Gursanah Cheh Kaare Kunad Chehl Nar)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
