DESCRIPTION:16 Bhadon 2084 · 16 Bhadon\, Sambat 2084 (Pehla Parkash SGGS · Mahan Kosh Note)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:52 PM\, 1 Sept\nCommemorating the six SGGS Bhagat Sahibaan whose exact birth days are unrecorded in Puratan chronicles: Bhagat Trilochan Ji (Ang 92\, 525\, 695)\, Bhagat Beni Ji (Ang 93\, 489\, 1351)\, Bhagat Bhikhan Ji (Ang 659)\, Bhagat Sadhna Ji (Ang 858)\, Bhagat Parmanand Ji (Ang 1253)\, and Bhagat Surdas Ji (Ang 1253).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 92\, 93\, 489\, 525\, 659\, 695\, 858\, 1253\, 1351 · Bhagat Bani) | Mahan Kosh (Bhai Kahn Singh Nabha) (Entries: Trilochan\, Beni\, Bhikhan\, Sadhna\, Parmanand\, Surdas)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
