DESCRIPTION:25 Maghar 2086 · 25 Maghar\, Sambat 2086\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:52 AM\, 10 Dec\nHonoring Mata Sundri Ji (Mata of Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji)\, who guided the Khalsa Panth for nearly four decades from Delhi and commissioned Bhai Mani Singh Ji’s seva at Sri Amritsar Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Hukamnamas of Mata Sundri Ji (Entry: Sundri (Mata) · Sambat 1804 Delhi Archive)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
