DESCRIPTION:6 Poh 2086 · 6 Poh\, Sambat 2086\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:38 AM\, 22 Dec\nOpening of Shaheedi Hafta: after an eight-month siege\, Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji\, the Guru Ghar Parivar\, and the Khalsa evacuated Qila Anandgarh on the freezing night of 6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Prachin Panth Prakash (6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761 · Evacuation of Qila Anandgarh)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
