DESCRIPTION:8 Poh 2086 · 8 Poh\, Sambat 2086\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:57 AM\, 24 Dec\nSupreme martyrdom of three of the original Panj Pyare—Bhai Himmat Singh Ji (Jagannath Puri)\, Bhai Mohkam Singh Ji (Dwarka)\, and Bhai Sahib Singh Ji (Bidar)—alongside the Vadde Sahibzade and 40 Singhs at Garhi Chamkaur.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Prachin Panth Prakash (8 Poh\, Sambat 1761 · Garhi Sri Chamkaur Sahib Martyrs)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
