DESCRIPTION:7 Phagun 2086 · Phagun Vadhi 1 (7 Phagun\, Sambat 2086)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:06 AM\, 19 Feb\nSupreme peaceful martyrdom of Bhai Lachhman Singh Ji Dharowali\, Bhai Dalip Singh Ji\, and over 130 Singhs on 20–21 February 1921 liberating Gurdwara Janam Asthan Sri Nankana Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1412 · Salok Vaaran Te Vadhik (Mahalla 1)) | Saka Nankana Sahib Historical Chronicle (SGPC / Gurdwara Sudhar Lehar) (Phagun 1977 Bikrami (20–21 Feb 1921) · Liberation of Janam Asthan Sri Nankana Sahib)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
