DESCRIPTION:28 Phagun 2086 · 28 Phagun\, Sambat 2086\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:24 AM\, 13 Mar\nKhalsa conquest of the Red Fort in Delhi (Sambat 1839) led by Baba Baghel Singh Ji\, Sardar Jassa Singh Ahluwalia\, and Sardar Jassa Singh Ramgarhia\, establishing historic Delhi Gurdwaras.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Delhi Fateh & Gurdwara Seva · Phagun Sambat 1839)\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
